What you need to do is get a copy of termcap from a unix machine, and
stash it in your directory (the directory where it looks for termcap).
Take a look in it to make sure that there is an entry marked vt100-80.
if not, then copy one of the vt100 entries, and label it vt100-80.  
I had the same problem when I ported 3.0pl7 to our vms box.  It works.  
Have fun.


